msgctxt "64"
msgid ""
"Got fond memories tradin' blows with ya here, Kiryu-chan. Too bad it's a "
"damn ghost town now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "76"
msgid "The Coliseum's closed?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "88"
msgid ""
"Been so for 'bout a year now. Somethin' else came up, pulled\r\n"
"my attention away."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "100"
msgid "Something like the Okinawa resort deal?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "124"
msgid "Guess the viper's outta the bag, huh?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "136"
msgid "Majima-san. Why did you do it? Why get involved?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "148"
msgid "I was keepin' my eye out for Daigo. Just like we promised."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "160"
msgid "What do you mean?"
msgstr "Cosa intendi?"

msgctxt "172"
msgid "I was just... tryin' to make shit easier for him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "184"
msgid "Y'know how intense all that politics bull can get."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "196"
msgid "But Daigo didn't want any part of the resort deal."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "208"
msgid "That's what got him shot. Right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "220"
msgid "Been wonderin' about that myself."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "232"
msgid "Majima-san."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "244"
msgid "...Kiryu-chan."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "256"
msgid ""
"I don't think you could've come up with this whole resort\r\n"
"scheme on your own. You have to be working with someone."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "268"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "280"
msgid "The question is, who is it?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "292"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "304"
msgid "Why aren't you saying anything?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "316"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "328"
msgid "Majima-san. Tell me the truth, now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3968"
msgid "Majima"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3972"
msgid "Kiryu"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3976"
msgid "Talk_Yes"
msgstr ""
